{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "waro-public-api-v1",
		"name": "Waro Colombia - Public API (Token Auth)",
		"description": "Endpoints publicos de Waro Colombia que usan autenticacion por API Token.\n\n## Configuracion\n1. Importa el environment \"Waro Colombia - Local (Puerto 9999)\"\n2. Configura la variable `api_token` con tu token generado en /integraciones\n\n## Scopes requeridos\n- `orders:read` o `read` para endpoints de ventas\n- `menu:read` o `read` para endpoints de menu",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{api_token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Sales (Ventas)",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Listar Ventas",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"limit\": 50,\n    \"offset\": 0,\n    \"sortField\": \"order_date\",\n    \"sortDirection\": \"desc\",\n    \"timezone\": \"America/Bogota\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/sales",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"v1",
								"sales"
							]
						},
						"description": "Obtiene la lista de ventas del tenant.\n\n**Scope requerido:** `orders:read` o `read`\n\n**Parametros disponibles:**\n- `limit`: 1-250 (default: 50)\n- `offset`: paginacion (default: 0)\n- `search`: termino de busqueda\n- `searchField`: order_number, customer_name, customer_phone\n- `paymentMethod`: cash, card, digital\n- `status`: completed, cancelled, pending\n- `sortField`: order_number, order_date, total_amount, customer_name, payment_method\n- `sortDirection`: asc, desc\n- `dateFrom`: YYYY-MM-DD\n- `dateTo`: YYYY-MM-DD\n- `timezone`: Zona horaria IANA (default: America/Bogota)"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Listar Ventas - Con Filtros",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
